it until it comes to the drive through RPG. Would you guys mind giving me a description for each of the Horrors on the characters art?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T14:24:04-07:00","id":968738,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daigotsu Max</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/882370-ask-the-writer-beast-ready-made-pcs?p=968702#post968702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No problem. Might be worth flagging as an errata - or maybe it's just that there's no room for them on the sheet :P</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, there's not a slot for them on the sheet we used, and I forgot that the stat blocks as written in the text version don't show up in the pdf (they get converted into the sheets, doy). Someone wants to add that to errata, I can add them to the text.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T23:35:22-07:00","id":969045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/882370-ask-the-writer-beast-ready-made-pcs?p=968705#post968705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I Will not be able to get it until it comes to the drive through RPG. Would you guys mind giving me a description for each of the Horrors on the characters art?</div> </div> </div> </div>Aside from the art, there's also descriptions of the Horrors in the characters' writeups.<br /> <br /> 11-foot giant covered in form-fitting sheets of ice.<br /> <br /> A rocky figure, a mass of soot and dirt that rots everything around it.<br /> <br /> Snake-tailed woman with razor-sharp teeth and long hair that shifts colour like oil.<br /> <br /> Lanky, hairless thing with scalpels on the edge of spindly fingers, with gleaming dark eyes and skin like rubber that droops from the face and neck.<br /> <br /> A gargoyle-like creature, a moving shadow with sharp edges that absorbs anything and anyone in its path. Looking into the shadow causes a feeling of dread that it knows the viewer more deeply and intimately than they could know themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T23:40:56-07:00","id":969050,"title":"","content":"How does everyone like the Changeling that made it in? I'm very curious about them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T00:40:02-07:00","id":969072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/882370-ask-the-writer-beast-ready-made-pcs?p=968738#post968738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yeah, there's not a slot for them on the sheet we used, and I forgot that the stat blocks as written in the text version don't show up in the pdf (they get converted into the sheets, doy). Someone wants to add that to errata, I can add them to the text.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Done.<br /> <br /> Also, in my Beast campaign one of my players is playing an Anakim who's a school principal, so he was over the moon to see he wasn't the only one who had this idea <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Edit: just finished reading through the book. Very solid product. I like the concepts, in particular the Rotting Debris and Scalpel Hands Horrors. There are some interesting concepts in there too. I probably won't use the characters as PCs - my players already have theirs - but they might show up as NPCs, or at the very least inspirational material. Well done!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10272,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","user":"Daigotsu Max","date":". 09-14-2016, 05:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T02:52:42-07:00","id":969111,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/882370-ask-the-writer-beast-ready-made-pcs?p=969045#post969045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Aside from the art, there's also descriptions of the Horrors in the characters' writeups.<br /> <br /> 11-foot giant covered in form-fitting sheets of ice.<br /> <br /> A rocky figure, a mass of soot and dirt that rots everything around it.<br /> <br /> Snake-tailed woman with razor-sharp teeth and long hair that shifts colour like oil.<br /> <br /> Lanky, hairless thing with scalpels on the edge of spindly fingers, with gleaming dark eyes and skin like rubber that droops from the face and neck.<br /> <br /> A gargoyle-like creature, a moving shadow with sharp edges that absorbs anything and anyone in its path. Looking into the shadow causes a feeling of dread that it knows the viewer more deeply and intimately than they could know themselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you marin","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T07:19:33-07:00","id":969211,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/882370-ask-the-writer-beast-ready-made-pcs?p=969050#post969050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How does everyone like the Changeling that made it in? I'm very curious about them.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I would love to hear what people think of her too! And please remember that she is meant to be a child--sixteen, but a child, in a transition period, but a child.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T07:24:50-07:00","id":969214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daigotsu Max</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/882370-ask-the-writer-beast-ready-made-pcs?p=969072#post969072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit: just finished reading through the book. Very solid product. I like the concepts, in particular the Rotting Debris and Scalpel Hands Horrors. There are some interesting concepts in there too. I probably won't use the characters as PCs - my players already have theirs - but they might show up as NPCs, or at the very least inspirational material. Well done!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you! So glad you're happy. I know you were looking forward to this.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T08:42:48-07:00","id":969243,"title":"","content":"Personally I loved the Changeling's backstory and character details. I especially love how she (and all of the characters) fits into the brood so nicely. My only complaint would be that I wish she was done in 2nd ed rules, but that shouldn't really be too difficult to convert. <br /> <br /> I do have one question and I don't know if this should be errata, but I saw the family ties listed on Annika, but I didn't see it listed anywhere else. Shouldn't it at least be on Maia?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5610-aslan751","name":"aslan751","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5610_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T09:03:46-07:00","id":969252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>aslan751</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/882370-ask-the-writer-beast-ready-made-pcs?p=969243#post969243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally I loved the Changeling's backstory and character details. I especially love how she (and all of the characters) fits into the brood so nicely. My only complaint would be that I wish she was done in 2nd ed rules, but that shouldn't really be too difficult to convert.<br /> <br /> I do have one question and I don't know if this should be errata, but I saw the family ties listed on Annika, but I didn't see it listed anywhere else. Shouldn't it at least be on Maia?</div> </div> </div> </div>Matt told me to use the Beast conversion rules for a character whose line wasn't 2E yet. I'm glad you like her! And when Changeling 2E comes out, I'll probably convert her myself, so I can post that when I do, unless y'all would prefer to do it yourselves.<br /> <br /> And it should 100% be Maia, I included that in my drafts. Matt, is that something else we should add to the errata page?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T09:12:37-07:00","id":969256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hm8453a</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/882370-ask-the-writer-beast-ready-made-pcs?p=969252#post969252\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Matt told me to use the Beast conversion rules for a character whose line wasn't 2E yet. I'm glad you like her! And when Changeling 2E comes out, I'll probably convert her myself, so I can post that when I do, unless y'all would prefer to do it yourselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>I kinda figured that's what h