Very happy with it.<br /> <br /> Now to start pestering Matt for the Player's Guide <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T13:23:41-07:00","id":972677,"title":"","content":"If you could add one additional Ready Made PC to the current brood, do you feel like a particular &quot;niche&quot; is empty? Obviously, broad representation of the families and hungers are present, but do you have any ideas for if we had say... a larger group?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>International Relations Scholar, Salesman, and GM. Guess which one of those is my favorite?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12305-obrimosmaintenance","name":"ObrimosMaintenance","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T18:51:19-07:00","id":972869,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ObrimosMaintenance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/882370-ask-the-writer-beast-ready-made-pcs?p=972677#post972677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you could add one additional Ready Made PC to the current brood, do you feel like a particular &quot;niche&quot; is empty? Obviously, broad representation of the families and hungers are present, but do you have any ideas for if we had say... a larger group?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sure I could come up with some, but I think the group is pretty well-rounded. Instead, why don't I tell y'all the story of how and why I made Malik a tracker? Let's go.<br /> <br /> True story, when I was younger, I worked for political campaigns. In 2012, I was one of the (if not the) youngest senior campaign staff members for a major campaign, and my candidate won her seat in the House of Representatives. Side note, I actually hate her now. ANYWHO. I went to undergrad with another woman who worked on campaigns. No names will be given, and the state will also not be given. But my friend was nineteen or twenty years old at the time, and she worked on a campaign for a woman who (another side note) became really famous nation-wide in 2013. So, my friend was a tracker for this politician. And one night, my friend was at an event for the opponent, pretending to be a young member of his party, and a supporter. Fake FB page and everything. At this event, another politician, not the opponent, just someone else at the event, came up to her and said, &quot;it's a good thing I don't have a pretty young thing like you in my office, or I'd get into trouble.&quot; And my friend had all of this recorded, because she was at the event as a tracker. So the campaign got that tape, and I actually don't know what if anything happened, but yeah, ANYWAY, I really, really wanted to make a tracker character, as a sort of homage to my friend, and that's where that came from. The end.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T21:52:19-07:00","id":972943,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hm8453a</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/882370-ask-the-writer-beast-ready-made-pcs?p=972869#post972869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm sure I could come up with some, but I think the group is pretty well-rounded. Instead, why don't I tell y'all the story of how and why I made Malik a tracker? Let's go.<br /> <br /> True story, when I was younger, I worked for political campaigns. In 2012, I was one of the (if not the) youngest senior campaign staff members for a major campaign, and my candidate won her seat in the House of Representatives. Side note, I actually hate her now. ANYWHO. I went to undergrad with another woman who worked on campaigns. No names will be given, and the state will also not be given. But my friend was nineteen or twenty years old at the time, and she worked on a campaign for a woman who (another side note) became really famous nation-wide in 2013. So, my friend was a tracker for this politician. And one night, my friend was at an event for the opponent, pretending to be a young member of his party, and a supporter. Fake FB page and everything. At this event, another politician, not the opponent, just someone else at the event, came up to her and said, &quot;it's a good thing I don't have a pretty young thing like you in my office, or I'd get into trouble.&quot; And my friend had all of this recorded, because she was at the event as a tracker. So the campaign got that tape, and I actually don't know what if anything happened, but yeah, ANYWAY, I really, really wanted to make a tracker character, as a sort of homage to my friend, and that's where that came from. The end.</div> </div> </div> </div>And shit like this is exactly why I'm obsessed with using DC and Ottawa as settings for Chronicles. There's enough cannon fodder with just mortals to launch an army, nevermind when you toss supernaturals into the mix.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T07:48:54-07:00","id":973136,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/882370-ask-the-writer-beast-ready-made-pcs?p=972943#post972943\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And shit like this is exactly why I'm obsessed with using DC and Ottawa as settings for Chronicles. There's enough cannon fodder with just mortals to launch an army, nevermind when you toss supernaturals into the mix.</div> </div> </div> </div>The first campaign I ever ran was a mage game set in DC. The players were set to an investigation of a slasher who evoked vampirism in his murders. And then they actually had to recover a Changeling from the Cheiron Group. The same Changeling Annika is based on, but she was eight in the game (side note, if you go to her character sheet at the link below, you can see the photo-reference I sent Matt). The Cheiron Group had drafted a pediatric endocrinologist (who was the biological father of another mage, a twenty-two year old woman named Meadowlark who was in a relationship with one of the Councilors) to study if there was anyway for them to mimic her thermal adaption in medical care.<br /> <br /> That was a nice game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":3093,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","user":"hm8453a","date":". 09-20-2016, 10:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T07:49:24-07:00","id":973137,"title":"","content":"If you're curious:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://the-freshman-class.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://the-freshman-class.obsidianportal.com/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T10:15:44-07:00","id":973209,"title":"","content":"The Addison character was the reference pic? There were some... Artistic Liberties taken. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>International Relations Scholar, Salesman, and GM. Guess which one of those is my favorite?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12305-obrimosmaintenance","name":"ObrimosMaintenance","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0